<section class="block">
  <div class="block-head">
    <h2>Protection Suite</h2>
    <span class="count">one licence</span>
  </div>
  <p class="lede">
    Buying premium for a server covers it in both bots. There is no second subscription and no
    second checkout, because two billing systems is two ways for money to go wrong.
  </p>

  <div class="pair">
    <div class="prod">
      <div class="top">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" width="17" height="17" aria-hidden="true">
          <rect width="32" height="32" rx="7" fill="var(--accent-ba)"/>
          <path d="M16 5.5l8.5 3.2v7.1c0 5.3-3.6 9.1-8.5 10.7-4.9-1.6-8.5-5.4-8.5-10.7V8.7L16 5.5z"
                fill="#fff"/>
          <path d="M11.8 16.1l3 3 5.4-5.7" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent-ba)" stroke-width="2.6"
                stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        </svg>
        <b>BotApprove</b><span class="tag">Live</span>
      </div>
      <p>
        The gate, keyword blocking, the audit trail, tamper detection and the dashboard are free
        forever. Premium adds threat intelligence and automation.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="prod">
      <div class="top">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" width="17" height="17" aria-hidden="true">
          <rect width="32" height="32" rx="7" fill="var(--accent-rp)"/>
          <path d="M9.4 9.2l4.8 2.1v4.65c0 3.45-2.02 6-4.8 7.05c-2.78-1.05-4.8-3.6-4.8-7.05V11.3L9.4 9.2z"
                fill="#fff" opacity=".5"/>
          <path d="M22.6 9.2l4.8 2.1v4.65c0 3.45-2.02 6-4.8 7.05c-2.78-1.05-4.8-3.6-4.8-7.05V11.3L22.6 9.2z"
                fill="#fff" opacity=".5"/>
          <path d="M16 7.4l5.8 2.52v5.58c0 4.14-2.44 7.2-5.8 8.46c-3.36-1.26-5.8-4.32-5.8-8.46V9.92L16 7.4z"
                fill="#fff"/>
        </svg>
        <b>RaidProtector</b><span class="tag">Beta</span>
      </div>
      <p>
        Raid detection, the reversible response and the incident record. Open to servers holding a
        licence while the beta runs.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="hint">
    <% if (typeof price !== 'undefined' && price) { %>
      Premium is <%= price.symbol %><%= price.amount %> a month per server and covers both bots.
    <% } %>
    Nothing that protects a server is ever behind the paywall. Premium is extras, and the
    dashboard says which is which.
  </p>
  <div class="actions">
    <a class="btn primary" href="/pricing">See what premium adds</a>
  </div>
</section>
